  "Mergify's analysis of 200,000+ merges across 477 teams found the rate of green PRs breaking main rose from 0.77% at 2–5 engineers to 12.5% (1 in 8) at 40+ engineers.": 1,
  "On private repos, failed batches bundle about six PRs on average, so one bad change can stall five good ones.": 1,
  "The broken-main rate for green PRs rises about 16x with team size, from 0.8% (about 1 in 130) at 2–5 engineers to 12.5% (1 in 8) at 40+ engineers.": 1
